  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fight Malnutrition in Filipino Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The scope of the project is the distribution of healthy and nutritious meals to indigenous children attending Lantuyang Elementary School and Adong Mangyan School on Mindoro Island, in the Philippines.  Children in this area of the island are severely affected by malnutrition, which leads to developmental and health issues and hinders their capacity to learn and their access to education.</narrative>
  </description>
